### 1. Create Fresh Housekeeping Task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhYjc3NzZkZWE1M2VmOTllNjE4NWVjZiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MDQxMTYxMSwiZXhwIjoxNzkxMDE2NDExfQ.pK0gyvbVjhbHdGiCYxa8goNTPD1O1qpFGxbGxu3nLiA

{
  "title": "Deep clean Room 101",
  "description": "Full sanitization, bedsheets change, and floor polish.",
  "room": "6ab78413a4d15d4b78c1bd37",
  "taskType": "Housekeeping",
  "priority": "High"
}

